# Machinist's Arsenal: job select makes a 1/1 Hero and attaches it. "Equipped creature gets +2/+2 for each artifact you control and is
# an Artificer in addition to its other types": with Bot1's five artifacts (four Moxen and the Arsenal) the Hero is an 11/11 Hero
# Artificer; the opponent's Mox Emerald does not count. Machina, Equip {4}, moves it to Savannah Lions (2/1 -> 12/11), the pool
# empty after paying, and the Hero is a plain 1/1 again.

